# What each binary package installs: PACKAGE MODE SOURCE DESTINATION.
# debian/rules installs exactly these rows and nothing else.
# The converter, archive key, Qt pin, desktop drop-ins and tasksel descriptor are package-only files.
# @VERSION@ is the content of the top-level VERSION file.

